#: ../../source/ontology.rst:4 4d14401a27aa455faabd8540346ed985
msgid "Field ontology"
msgstr "字段本体"

#: ../../source/ontology.rst:6 41c5f5b3d031485680c06642c477a958
msgid ""
"socid_extractor normalizes the data returned by every scheme onto a shared "
"set of **standard field names**. A profile parsed from Bluesky and a profile"
" parsed from XVideos both expose ``uid``, ``username`` and ``created_at`` "
"under the same keys, so a downstream pipeline consuming the output does not "
"need 130 platform-specific mappings — it learns one vocabulary and reuses it"
" everywhere."
msgstr ""
"socid_extractor 把每个提取方案返回的数据归一化到一套共享的 **标准字段名** 上。从 Bluesky 解析出的资料和从 XVideos"
" 解析出的资料，都在相同的键下暴露 ``uid``\\ 、\\ ``username`` 和 ``created_at``\\ "
"，因此消费这些输出的下游流水线不需要 130 套平台特定的映射 —— 它只需学会一套词汇，就能到处复用。"

#: ../../source/ontology.rst:12 f5125fce7e5b450db01d3e5c91a55a45
msgid ""
"The core rule when adding a scheme: **use an existing name from this page.**"
" Only create a platform-prefixed field (for example ``gaia_id``) when the "
"data does not fit any standard category."
msgstr ""
"添加提取方案时的核心规则：\\ **使用本页已有的名称。** 只有当数据不属于任何标准类别时，才创建带平台前缀的字段（例如 ``gaia_id``\\ "
"）。"

#: ../../source/ontology.rst:16 c56c0344ff324dca8ca1ac3698a578f3
msgid ""
"This page is a faithful rendering of ``FIELDS.md`` in the repository root. "
"See :doc:`adding-a-scheme` for how to wire these fields into a scheme, and "
":doc:`how-extraction-works` for how extraction produces them."
msgstr ""
"本页是仓库根目录中 ``FIELDS.md`` 的忠实呈现。关于如何把这些字段接入提取方案，见 :doc:`adding-a-"
"scheme`；关于提取如何产生这些字段，见 :doc:`how-extraction-works`。"

